          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ninenu nyikoku yami, nyikoku yahawudiilu wami, muyantu, ami nawa niNzambi yenu. Dimu mwanahoshiyi Mwanta Yehova.",
          "type": "text",
